  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY拼插帐篷棍子拼搭套装",
    "en": "DIY Interlocking Tent Rod Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款用于儿童DIY帐篷搭建的拼插棍子套装，采用PP材质，适合拆装房子、帐篷和通道等场景搭建。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山，适用于7-14岁儿童互动拼搭与教学活动场景。",
    "en": "This is a DIY interlocking tent rod set for children, made of PP material and suitable for building detachable house, tent, and tunnel-style structures.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. It is suitable for ages 7-14 in interactive construction and educational activity scenarios."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY拼插帐篷棍子拼搭套装以PP结构件为核心，适合用于儿童拼搭场景中的框架连接与形态扩展，支持多次拆装与组合。",
      "产品可用于亲子互动、益智课程和活动空间布置，覆盖空间认知、动手训练和协作搭建等使用需求。",
      "包装为彩盒，规格为72/158，参数清晰，便于渠道陈列、仓配管理和项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY interlocking tent rod set is built around PP structural components and is suitable for frame connection and shape extension in children’s construction-play scenarios, with repeatable assembly support.",
      "It can be used in parent-child interaction, educational sessions, and activity-space setup, covering spatial learning, hands-on training, and collaborative building use cases.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging with a 72/158 specification, making it suitable for channel display, warehouse operations, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
